{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-ellipse#card-zh","repo":"uckkk/dsh-ellipse","commit":"accc5c17409aa75db89146e2de1242267d3e0c20","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"椭圆面积是一个 DSH 插件工具：安装后会在 DSH 会话中注册椭圆面积计算工具 ellipse_area。调用时输入半长轴 a 和半短轴 b 两个数字，工具按 π×a×b 计算面积，并将结果四舍五入到小数点后四位，再以文本形式返回计算结果。适合在会话中快速完成椭圆面积计算；无需 API Key、账号或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:7-13","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-ellipse#card-en","repo":"uckkk/dsh-ellipse","commit":"accc5c17409aa75db89146e2de1242267d3e0c20","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"椭圆面积 (Ellipse Area) registers the ellipse_area calculator in a DSH session. It accepts numeric semi-axes a and b, computes π×a×b, and rounds the result to four decimal places. Use it to calculate ellipse areas during a session; no API key, account, or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:7-13","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
